ommunity by providing outreach and assistance.The Disability Coordination Specialist provides direct assistance to students with disabilities by:Setting up accommodations.Assisting in the coordination of accommodations with Faculty/Staff.Following up with students about their accommodations they are using.Participating in campu... View Details Bookmark Finance Coordinator - AVE Business Center AVE Business Center-3026 Staff 08/28/2026 09/14/2026 Join the Institute of Agriculture and Natural Resources (IANR) Business Centers, where we strive to deliver exceptional service, innovative solutions, and responsible stewardship that advance IANR’s teaching, research, and extension missions.As a Finance Coordinator, you will coordinate a wide range of financial transactions across multiple fund types, providing responsive support and ensuring ... View Details Bookmark Graduate Program Coordinator Entomology-0834 Staff 08/28/2026 09/14/2026 As the Graduate Program Coordinator, you will:Serve as the primary coordinator for graduate student support and provide general office management for the School combining Entomology and Plant Pathology, with primary responsibility for the Entomology graduate program and associated academic and administrative functions.Support prospective, incoming, and current M.S. and Ph.D. students throughout... View Details Bookmark Fitness Coordinator Campus Recreation-0965 Staff 08/28/2026 09/11/2026 The Fitness Coordinator provides leadership for the daily operation of Campus Recreation’s fitness facilities and Personal Training program. In this role you will oversee:Fitness OperationsOversee daily operation of all strength and cardiovascular fitness areas.Supervise student staff.Ensure safe, clean, and welcoming fitness environments.Develop and implement operational policies and procedure... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 Next Connect with #UNL UNLincoln on Facebook @UNLincoln on Twitter UNL on YouTube @unlincoln on Instagram Universi