n Agricultural Banking and Finance position at the rank of assistant or associate professor. This 9-month (academic year), tenure-track appointment will develop and maintain nationally and internationally recognized research, tea... View Details Bookmark Extension Instructor or Open Rank Extension Educator - 4-H Youth Development (Lincoln County) NE Ext Engagement Zone 3-12352 Faculty 07/15/2026 09/04/2026 OVERVIEWThis position is based in North Platte, NE, with the geographic accountability region of Lincoln, Logan, and McPherson Counties. The major responsibility of this position is to provide regional leadership for Nebraska Extension’s 4-H and Youth Development Program. This extension professional is expected to interact closely with 4-H clientele in these communities and deliver programs in ... View Details Bookmark Extension Instructor or Open Rank Extension Educator - 4-H Youth Development (Merrick County) NE Ext Engagement Zone 7-12356 Faculty 08/27/2026 09/30/2026 OVERVIEWThis position is based in Central City, NE, with the geographic accountability region of Merrick and Hamilton Counties. The major responsibility of this position is to provide regional leadership for Nebraska Extension’s 4-H and Youth Development Program. This extension professional is expected to interact closely with 4-H clientele in these communities and deliver programs in their geo... View Details Bookmark Extension Instructor or Open Rank Extension Educator - 4-H Youth Development (Garden County) NE Ext Engagement Zone 1-12350 Faculty 07/28/2026 10/02/2026 OVERVIEWThis position is based in Oshkosh, NE, with the geographic accountability region of Garden and Morrill Counties. The major responsibility of this position is to provide regional leadership for Nebraska Extension’s 4-H and Youth Development Program. This extension professional is expected to interact closely with 4-H clientele in these communities and deliver programs in their geographic... View Details Bookmark Extension Instructor or Open Rank Extension Educator - Health and Wellbeing (Hamilton County) NE Ext Engagement Zone 7-12356 Faculty 08/31/2026 10/05/2026 OVERVIEWThis position is based in Aurora, Nebraska, with a geographic accountability region of Hamilton, Merrick, Clay, Nuckolls, Thayer, and Fillmore Counties.The Health & Wellbeing Extension professional engages Nebraskans through research-based education, partnerships, and community-based approaches that help people live healthier, safer, and more resilient lives. The educator identifies... View Details Bookmark Assistant/Associate/Full Professor College of Law-0899 Faculty 09/04/2026 10/09/2026 The University of Nebraska College of Law invites applications for entry-level and lateral candidates for multiple tenure-track or tenured faculty positions, depending on the candidate’s experience.The primary course needs are First-Year Property and Federal Income Tax. Other course needs include Torts, Corporate Tax, Partnership Tax, Tax-related seminar, Professional Responsibility, Privacy La... View Details Bookmark Extension Instructor or Open Rank Extension Educator - HLES (Scotts Bluff County) NE Ext Engagement Zone 1-12350 Faculty 07/27/2026 10/16/2026 OVERVIEWThis is a full-time, 12-month non-tenure track position based in Scottsbluff, NE, with a geographic accountability region including Banner, Box Bute, Cheyenne, Dawes, Deuel, Garden, Kimball, Morrill, Scotts Bluff, Sheridan, and Sioux Counties. This education professional’s primary responsibility is to develop and deliver educational programs and resources in horticulture or related fiel... View Details Bookmark Connect with #UNL UNLincoln on Facebook @UNLincoln on Twitter UNL on YouTube @unlincoln on Instagram University of Nebraska–Lincoln on LinkedIn unlincoln on Pinterest UNLincoln on Snapchat unlincoln on Spotify Campus Links Directory Employment Events Libraries Maps Office of the Chancellor Nebraska Today Policies Emergency Planning and Preparedness Institutional